    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="29">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Ine">Ine</ref> 29</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">{LXXIII} Gif mon sweordes onlæne oðres esne, ⁊ he losie, gielde he hine ðriddan dæle; gif mon spere selle, healfne; gif he horses onlæne, ealne he hine gylde.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If someone lends a sword to another’s esne and he escapes, let [the lender] pay [the lord] one third [of the esne’s value]; if he gives a spear, half; if he lends a horse, he compensates [the lord] for all [the value of the esne]</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">If anyone lends a sword to the servant of another man, and he makes off, he [the lender] shall pay him [the owner of the servant] a third [of his value]. If he provides [the servant] with a spear, [he shall pay the owner] half [the value of the servant]. If he lends [the servant] a horse, he shall pay him [the owner] the full value [of the servant].</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif mon sweordes onlæne oþres ésne, ⁊ he losige, gilde he hine ðriddan dæle; gif mon spere sylle, healfne (dæl) hine gilde; gif mon horses læne, ealne he hine gilde.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
